{"id":"t18462","key":"night of the comet|1984","csv":{"title":"Night of the Comet","year":1984,"directors":["Thom Eberhardt"],"rating":6,"watchedDate":"2023-11-17"},"status":"ok","tmdb":{"tmdbId":18462,"imdbId":"tt0087799","wikidataId":"Q743872","title":"La nuit de la comète","originalTitle":"Night of the Comet","altTitles":["La nuit de la comète","Noc komety","La noche del cometa","La Noche del Cometa","A Noite do Cometa","Der Komet – Der Tod kommt aus dem All"],"tagline":"Après cette nuit là, le monde ne sera plus comme avant.","overview":"Après le passage d'une comète à proximité de la Terre, presque toute la population mondiale est décimée. Regina et sa sœur Samantha survivent et vont trouver refuge dans le studio d'une radio locale. Elles y rencontrent Hector, un routier protégé par la cabine en acier de son engin. Dans ce monde dévasté, les jeunes filles commencent par faire du shopping, mais ce sera sans compter sur des survivants mutants agressifs, et une équipe de scientifiques cherchant à créer un sérum permettant de guérir ce mal.","overviewLang":"fr","releaseDate":"1984-11-16","runtime":95,"status":"Released","genres":["Comédie","Horreur","Science-Fiction"],"genreIds":[35,27,878],"countries":["United States of America"],"originCountry":["US"],"languages":["English"],"originalLanguage":"en","directors":["Thom Eberhardt"],"directorIds":[68381],"writers":["Thom Eberhardt"],"composers":["David Campbell"],"cinematographers":["Arthur Albert"],"editors":["Fred Stafford"],"producers":["Wayne Crawford","Andrew Lane"],"cast":[{"id":50880,"name":"Robert Beltran","character":"Hector","profilePath":"/4Y9zzqveAeiI55VRC6mPyLQroHe.jpg"},{"id":55266,"name":"Catherine Mary Stewart","character":"Regina","profilePath":"/vfqO0CmD7gkNwr8ErEm82F8bOqL.jpg"},{"id":83151,"name":"Kelli Maroney","character":"Samantha","profilePath":"/zGzOX9doZPIfoTw5t0zYGZH0Lj4.jpg"},{"id":19434,"name":"Sharon Farrell","character":"Doris","profilePath":"/42dQ4WRePvqrdNwLjoRfimngWdo.jpg"},{"id":1005